{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28260","headline":"长安送友人游湖南 · 杜牧","name":"长安送友人游湖南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子性剧弘和，愚衷深褊狷。\n相舍嚣譊中，吾过何由鲜。\n楚南饶风烟，湘岸苦萦宛。\n山密夕阳多，人稀芳草远。\n青梅繁枝低，斑笋新梢短。\n莫哭葬鱼人，酒醒且眠饭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}